```sql
--Description / thinking process:
-- Goal: return the single calendar day in 2016 whose number of “PUBLIC INTOXICATION” incidents
-- has the second‑highest Z‑score.
-- • Step‑1  Filter the 2016 incident table so only rows whose `descript`
